    "Shared single-line input component composes the measured border before field fill; choice-button corners add their white fill afterward",
    "ReadOnly/disabled inputs use their parent backdrop; explicit borders lighten by 76, automatic borders use #d7d7d7",
    "Disabled numeric text is neutral gray from ceil(max(original field fill RGB)/2), independent of parent backdrop and own TextColor",
    "ReadOnly hides the automatic numeric choice; an explicit ChoiceButton overrides it. Logical width excludes the one-pixel button paint outset",
    "Side-label allocation rounds to the nearest CSS pixel; forty-eight native forms verify exact field positions and sizes",
    "Dirty ancestor appearance changes repaint retained Solid input/corner nodes. Actual main and floating workbench PNGs are decoded and checked with zero tolerance",
